// The eval-once invariant at a *primitive* call site, the shape the wrapper
// `caps_double_eval` pins for `fs.read_text`. `mk()` prints on every call and
// names an in-grant path the first time and `/etc/passwd` the second, so a
// stdout with one `SIDE` says the check and the call read the same evaluation.
impl "util" caps(fs = ["__KELP_SCRATCH__/kelp_caps_raw_double_eval/**"])

fun main() {
    print(util.inside_once())
    print(util.outside())
}
